      "source": "Local film review",
      "decision": "setup1",
      "note": "So this game is interesting because each time carolina receiveson offensive, it does seem like they are completing two set up passes. However the first pass is always a centering pass. I also think one of hte reasons why they are doing two passes is because they know that Philadelphia is going to try and poach, so by getting the disc closer to the sideline, it allows them to avoid the defenders who sag in the lane when the disc is in the middle of the field."
